  table-structure model — PaddleOCR (Apache License 2.0), downloaded by
  `scripts/fetch_models.sh`. The models are not distributed from this
  repository; the script fetches them at build time and verifies SHA-256 sums.
- ONNX Runtime — MIT License.
- PDFium — BSD 3-Clause License (Copyright 2014 Google Inc.), loaded
  dynamically for local PDF rasterisation.
- Tauri, React, Tailwind CSS and the Rust crates in `Cargo.lock` — under their
  respective licences, as listed in each package's metadata.

